  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that<br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Adding them, we get,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mfrac>